    "description": "# RF-10: Dedup-on-Create (hard block)\n\n_Blocks Referrer creation outright on a matching email — no override for the creator._\n\n### AUTOMATION\n\n* Matching email (checked on both email fields) blocks creation outright\n\n* Kobi Kunasekaran, [1:42:05](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6125): \"we can start with like deduplication based on email. So if somebody tries to create a referrer... with the same email address as one that already exists, then they'll just be blocked from doing that.\" Checks both email fields — Joyce Kiddell, [1:41:46](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6106): \"some logic just around the email... looking at both email inputs.\"\n\n* No override for the creator\n\n* Escalate to someone with full access — Kobi Kunasekaran, [1:42:05](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6125): \"they'll have to reach out to somebody with... full access to confirm... whether it needs to be reassigned to a different BA or use a different email address.\"\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Interacts with RF-6's Duplicate Review section\n\n* See RF-6 for the open question on whether this hard block replaces that section or the two coexist.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-10 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-10 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 1:42:05 (hard block)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6125)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 1:41:46 (both email fields)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=6106)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
